*.mode2v3
*.pbuser
*.perspectivev3
*.xcworkspace
!default.xcworkspace
xcuserdata
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
DerivedData
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.xcuserstate

## Obj-C/Swift specific
*.hmap

## App packaging
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

